      "content": "The `gdrive` CLI tool has two notable versions on GitHub:\n\n### 1. The Original `gdrive` (v2)\n* **Author:** **Petter Rasmussen** ([github.com/prasmussen](https://github.com/prasmussen))\n* **Repository:** [prasmussen/gdrive](https://github.com/prasmussen/gdrive)\n* **Stars:** **~8,950 ⭐**\n* **Status:** This is the original, widely popular implementation in Go. However, it is no longer actively maintained.\n\n---\n\n### 2. The Modern Maintained Fork (v3)\n* **Author / Maintainer:** **glotlabs** ([github.com/glotlabs](https://github.com/glotlabs))\n* **Repository:** [glotlabs/gdrive](https://github.com/glotlabs/gdrive)\n* **Stars:** **~2,100 ⭐**\n* **Status:** This is the actively maintained continuation rewritten for Drive API v3 with multi-account support. This is also the version installed when running `brew install gdrive`."
